@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam ArrowColor #17354c
skinparam classBackgroundColor #edf5f7
skinparam classBorderColor #087f8c
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title D04 | Submission assessment state machine
[*] --> RECEIVED : first submit [valid scope/file]\n/ save immutable version
RECEIVED --> RECEIVED : resubmit [t <= D]\n/ append version
RECEIVED --> MARKED : mark [t > D; current row]\n/ assessment + event
MARKED --> MARKED : revise / event + revision
MARKED --> MODERATED : HoD moderate [current revision]\n/ save approval + event
MODERATED --> MARKED : HoD return / clear approval + event
MARKED --> MARKED : HoD return / reason + event
MODERATED --> RELEASED : HoD release [current revision]\n/ release metadata + event
RELEASED --> MARKED : HoD reopen / hide + clear approval + event
note right of RECEIVED
ON TIME / LATE are derived receipt labels.
First late work is accepted at any lateness.
D = max(base, class, individual).
end note
note right of RELEASED
Only RELEASED is student-visible.
Every assessment transition is atomic with audit.
No final deletion state is exposed.
end note
@enduml
